<title>Ecuador's security crisis: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/ecuador/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-ecuador-2026-10-23T07:47:20.153Z</guid>
<pubDate>Fri, 23 Oct 2026 07:47:20 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Prison riots in two Ecuadorian facilities have left eight inmates dead and ten injured, as gangs clash inside the prisons. The violence follows a series of deadly confrontations that have marked the country's security crisis since 2018, rooted in criminal organizations linked to drug trafficking. The latest incidents show the crisis extending into the penitentiary system, whereas earlier reporting focused on street-level conflict and a priest’s death in Guayaquil. The crisis recorded two battle-related deaths in 2019, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMijwFBVV95cUxQaG9EckU5RVp4UmhjSVlPQ0x5RGs3TGNpWXktSEVILXZHS1IzWlAyM25tU3pIeEFYWnJOdndHUnE0d1IxVGs3eVpudUItTmFNQUFvbzBicTFDc3lVUTZRazNXbk0zTTdsQmJnT1BUYnVmS21UeDFVYlhuNzFpdzZDTEM0cEhIZFlIbWxvY2YyNA?oc=5&quot;&gt;Anadolu Ajansı&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMijwFBVV95cUxOWXhDdWJ4QlMxTnpaZm04RkpzYnd2Mmpad21qb2xCeVlaaFRCOWdDMEJIVElGTWU2NjVLOUlreVBlOXNwNmRoaDV5T3VleTJaVjRBTzBLUWN2Y2RJeVFockg0T3RRWG5aM0VpSzJadHltcEtid09EcjBpRkkwQV90TVEyS2dWX29QWEdXUS0xdw?oc=5&quot;&gt;News of Bahrain&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMikgFBVV95cUxNamItWlpsMm9STjFkbjRUdUlIWWFJMWxIUElhdHZHbXk4MU1udGotMWtMcFFZQm1fbUhfSUh3N3IyWS03UVBwRHdqZXVSTWNnbVpBa053aTFOWWVVNTVDQjQ3V2JRSUJISS1Ib1BRMzlRX2hXa0o2UEdxUHlGaFd4anpUekJQQTRYancybVRlZFN6Zw?oc=5&quot;&gt;Yahoo&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiggFBVV95cUxPc000dzFNQ0Z4ZHhfdGZESlNaUF9wWUtEQXVST0dDY1VqdWwyYlIyRUxvY0VhNVJaS2hqUFRhR1BCMkZPVzdCcGFmdFBxSHRXTzlsSERNeFBsOV9IYzdadEIwMHE4aGV4NnBVSmZfd2tqMFgyeEZPLUNtV3d4OUNDMGpn?oc=5&quot;&gt;Yahoo News Canada&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiigFBVV95c